Full Description:
Claira’s deal intelligence platform for finance automates your deal pipeline, deal origination and deal management while streamlining business processes, enabling deep business insights, & empowering business leaders to make more informed decisions.

Whether you're working on behalf of your firm or providing advisory, consulting or legal services across multiple firms, Claira will assist you in achieving efficiency, control, compliance and risk management across a variety of finance & insurance business areas:  
* Private Credit Analysis;
* Investment Management;
* Commercial Real Estate;
* Asset Management;  
* Capital Markets;  
* Commercial Real Estate;  
* Corporate Banking;  
* Credit and Lending; 
* Digital Assets;  
* Fund Administration;  
* Hedge Funds;  
* Insurance;  
* Investment Banking, M&A;  
* Investment Management;  
* Legal, Reg, & Compliance;  
* Prime Brokerage;  
* Private Equity, Private Placement, VC;  
* Real Estate;  
* Retail Banking;  
* Wealth Management;  
etc.

Claira is pre-trained and pre-configured with insight modules that don't require your time and effort to train our models on your documents.  

Claira's unique approach using computational linguistics and sentence-level, deep-semantic parsing provides greater understanding and higher accuracy. 

Claira's answers are fully traceable and transparent because Claira understands language, just like you.  For each document, Claira shows you how we concluded for you to understand and be fully confident in your actions. 

Claira was created by top data scientists and engineers experienced in solving complex non-finance problems alongside financial service experts on a mission to digitize traditional finance.

Claira launched in 2024 and is based in New York, USA.

DoorSpace is transforming the way healthcare organizations retain and develop clinical talent. We have an innovative solution that flips the script on the usual question “what makes people leave?”, and instead asks “what makes people stay?”. 

We’ve built a platform specifically designed to make it easier for organizations to create a workplace where people want to stay. 

With our solution, healthcare organizations are better able to: 
* know your people, and build strong relationships with them 
* Reduce friction/frustration in clinician’s workflow by eliminating wasteful administrative tasks
* support your people more effectively in their career development

** All while dramatically reducing the amount of time your clinicians and your administrative team is spending on manual data entry and paper pushing. ** 

How We Do It: 

DoorSpace’s SaaS platform provides an intelligent data management system, enabling clinicians and their employers to collaborate, manage and maintain mission-critical personnel data. 

DoorSpace provides a “single source of truth” that is updated in real-time across the organization each time an employee’s data file changes. We provide organizations with the workforce data they need to make data-driven decisions, and we reduce the time high-value talent is spending on low-value administrative tasks. 

The immediate value DoorSpace provides our customers is that we clean up a lot of back office "clutter", automating the ongoing organization and maintenance of personnel data and documents. 

The long term value DoorSpace provides to healthcare leaders is transparency across their workforce with real-time reporting and superior data accuracy, enabling better, faster decisions. 

Specific Pain Points We Address: 

  * Clinicians and administrators wasting valuable time pushing paper and manually moving data from one silo’d system to another; 
  * Healthcare leaders wait months to get reports on the state of their workforce, delaying the resolution of serious problems until after impacted clinicians have quit; 
  * Inability to quickly identify clinician’s strengths and weaknesses to ensure strengths are leveraged while bolstering weaknesses with the right training; 
  * Delays that are weeks and often months long in getting things done - from placing a new clinician to billing insurance companies and every step along the way, back office inefficiencies 
    are costing organizations time and money they can’t afford to spend;
  * Employers need to both ramp up recruiting to keep staff - ratios, and they need to increase investment in retention with limited resources; 
  * Growing turnover and no insights or clear strategic retention plan beyond paying clinicians more money;
  * Growing frustration among clinicians, especially doctors and nurses, which has led to an increase in medical errors, nurse strikes, turnover, and disengagement from patient care work;

Openfabric is a platform for building and connecting AI-Apps, an ecosystem where everyone has quick, easy, low-cost, and hassle-free access to powerful AIs.

Openfabric addresses the most challenging problems faced by AI platforms by:
- Lowering the infrastructure demand and technical know-how required to utilize AI-Apps, facilitating new market opportunities;
- Simulating fair market competition as an essential factor to create large, vibrant, and collaborative communities;
- Leveraging blockchain technologies to ensure execution scalability and eliminate vendor lockup.

Techtrials is at the crossroad of the information age of the Healthcare industry, combining years of experience in the pharmaceutical industry in clinical development environment and healthcare data science, applying big data, analytics and Artificial Intelligence.



We have a simple mission: “based on our unique mix of capabilities and proprietary technology, we are committed to continuously provide valuable clinical and RWE insights for the Health Industry which needs to act and take critical decisions in their daily operations.”



Techtrials Analytics delivers unique clinical and strategic insights to the Health industry across the value chain, offering unmatched intelligence and analytics data solutions.



We are an innovative, agile and dynamic trusted partner of healthcare stakeholders in their quest for cost effective and premium real world evidence (RWE) and actionable insights.



Our proprietary analytics platform benefits, TT Health Explorers is a BI & RWE Analytics platform, with more than 10 TB billion registries and unique proprietary technologies, that aggregate more than 195 million unique anonymized patients, 100% of available structured Public & Private Health data in Brazil. It maps all diseases by providing highly valuable insights that uniquely help the pharmaceutical, healthcare and government industries.



Our superior data solution portfolio, powerful analytics platform and core service offering generate cost-effective and cutting-edge healthcare analytics to help healthcare stakeholders act faster and decisively:



TT Disease Explorer – Understanding Epidemiology and Outcomes with RWE insights from Outpatient and Inpatient setting with data from Procedures, Treatments, Surgeries and much more;

TT Onco Explorer – Understanding Epidemiology and Outcomes with RWE insights in Oncology from Outpatient and Inpatient setting with data from Procedures, Treatments, Surgeries and much more;

TT Rare Disease Explorer – Understanding Epidemiology and Outcomes with RWE insights in Rare Diseases from Outpatient and Inpatient setting with data from Procedures, Treatments, Surgeries and much more;

TT City Explorer – Public Health Strategic Management Tool combining RWD to understand the dynamics in each Brazilian municipality;

TT Hospital Explorer – Public Health Strategic Hospital Management Tool combining RWD to understand the dynamics in each Brazilian Public Hospital;

TT HCP Explorer – Healthcare Professionals Mapping Tool;

We're an innovative technology company with a mission to upskill the global workforce in the rapidly evolving fields of Data Science and AI. 

We partner with leading corporations and government organisations, providing them with:

- The know-how and industry specific best practices required to deliver AI projects from idea to production;

- High-quality expert programmes tailored to their needs, helping their workforce leverage new technologies to the best of their abilities;

- Flexible team structures capable of successfully implementing end-to-end AI projects;

- AI expert hires and/or dedicated cross-functional AI teams;
